            "content": "<p><strong>Most seasonal category:</strong> <em>Category 2</em> (GARDEN &amp; OUTDOOR).</p><p>It has the largest peak-to-trough swing in the full monthly history: <strong>$79,197.21</strong>, rising from a trough of <strong>$28,019.00</strong> in <strong>December 2020</strong> to a peak of <strong>$107,216.21</strong> in <strong>August 2025</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Peak month:</strong> August</li><li><strong>Trough month:</strong> December</li><li><strong>Seasonal swing magnitude:</strong> $79,197.21</li><li><strong>Month-to-month jump:</strong> largest observed increase was <strong>+$42,255.65</strong></li><li><strong>Month-to-month drop:</strong> largest observed decrease was <strong>-$46,156.97</strong></li></ul><p>For context, the next most seasonal category is <strong>Category 9</strong> (STORAGE &amp; ORGANIZATION) at <strong>$61,259.65</strong>, so Category 2\u2019s swing is larger by <strong>$17,937.56</strong>.</p>",
